msgid "These edits use a job posting, so they go to a copy of this resume made for that job. Copy it for the job and ask again there; this resume stays unchanged."
msgstr "እነዚህ ማስተካከያዎች የሥራ ማስታወቂያ ይጠቀማሉ፤ ስለዚህ ለዚያ ሥራ ወደተሰራ የዚህ የስራ ልምድ ማስረጃ ቅጂ ይሄዳሉ። ለሥራው ይቅዱት እና እዚያ እንደገና ይጠይቁ፤ ይህ የስራ ልምድ ማስረጃ ሳይቀየር ይቆያል።"

#: src/routes/builder/letter/-components/design-panel.tsx
msgid "These four follow the resume. Turn matching off to set them for this letter only; it starts from the values above."
